{"id": "q0340", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 16.85, "n_chunks": 17, "scores": [0.7756, 0.7423, 0.8212, 0.7696, 0.8596, 0.7917, 0.7524, 0.708, 0.8178, 0.6773, 0.7428, 0.8141, 0.6882, 0.8236, 0.75, 0.7003, 0.5273], "eot_score": 0.5125, "eot_read_ms": 24, "reference_answer": "Algeria", "query": "Set up in 1954 as a merger of smaller groups, the Front de Libration Nationale fought a war for independence from France until 1962, when the French government signed a cease-fire agreement. The FLN became the only legal party in which country?", "transcript": "Set up in nineteen fifty four as a merger of smaller groups, the Front de Libération Nationale fought a war for independence from France until nineteen sixty two, when the French government signed a ceasefire agreement. The FLN became the only legal party in which country?", "first_audio_ms": 594, "spoken_s": 4.08, "mode": "local", "answer": "The Front de Libération Nationale became the only legal party in Algeria.", "answer_ms": 1751}
{"id": "q0350", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 6.95, "n_chunks": 7, "scores": [0.6596, 0.7826, 0.7321, 0.7655, 0.6836, 0.7425, 0.7096], "eot_score": 0.4733, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Fire insurance", "query": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "transcript": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "first_audio_ms": 584, "spoken_s": 25.12, "mode": "local", "answer": "Nicholas Barbon, an English economist and physician, helped to pioneer **insurance against fire damage** in 1666. His involvement was significant in the development of early commercial insurance practices during a time when London faced frequent fires, including the Great Fire of London that year. While not the sole inventor, Barbon contributed ideas related to risk assessment and financial protection for property losses due to fire.", "answer_ms": 10639}
{"id": "q0359", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.7, "n_chunks": 4, "scores": [0.6947, 0.9951, 0.7679, 0.4461], "eot_score": 0.3851, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, Ohio, New York, New Jersey", "query": "For a point each, name the 6 states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "transcript": "For a point each, name the six states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "first_audio_ms": 555, "spoken_s": 8.6, "mode": "local", "answer": "The six states that border Pennsylvania are New York, New Jersey, Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, and Ohio.", "answer_ms": 3556}
